      "content": "wait ok so no butter, got it. but you said to use a thick layer of Vaseline... how thick should i put it? like should i just slather it on so it's really heavy? i'm worried if it's too thin it won't work. also is it okay if the blisters get a bit bigger as long as i don't pop them?",
